    "body": "> No, that doesn't require it to be done synchronously as far as I can tell.\r\n\r\nCan you elaborate? It seems like the picker should be opened synchronously or nearly-sync, right? I.e.\r\n\r\n```\r\nselect.showPicker();\r\nselect.matches(‘:open’); // true\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
