    "created_at": "2026-05-04T22:03:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-04T22:03:12Z",
    "body": "Just to come back around to this: we're still requiring a user gesture for base-select, and of course \"auto-select\". Are we statisfied with the state of play, enough to close this? Or should we pursue allowing showPicker() in base-select without a gesture?\n\nI think it's a little weird to allow it for base-select and not for auto, but I don't think it's super troublesome. So I am ambivalent.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
