    "created_at": "2026-05-04T23:01:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-04T23:01:09Z",
    "body": "I still think that it would be better to not require user activation to show the base appearance popover, but now that we can get user activation in WPT reftests I'm don't know if its actually blocking anything. I imagine that when customizable select becomes interoperable and web developers start using it more that this would come up again, but I haven't seen anyone else discover this as an issue yet.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
