    "created_at": "2026-05-11T11:40:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-11T11:40:50Z",
    "body": "Let's revisit this if a more concrete scenario comes up. I continue to think we should have as much parity between the different views on a `select` element as we can. Having API behavior depend on what view is in effect is a bit of a smell.",
